Package: lifeexp
Type: Package
Title: Six-Step Analysis of 1977 US State Life Expectancy
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person("wangqu631", email = "284178905+wangqu631@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A self-contained toolkit for the six-step analysis of the built-in
    state.x77 data set: read the table, draw a scatterplot matrix, fit a linear
    model for life expectancy, optimise it by AIC with an ANOVA check, report the
    regression coefficients as a standardised forest plot with two-tailed
    p-values, and compute the conditional confidence and prediction intervals for
    Hawaii (72.09317 years).
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0)
Imports: datasets, graphics, stats
URL: https://github.com/wangqu631/lifeexp
BugReports: https://github.com/wangqu631/lifeexp/issues
